Searching
1.Linear Search:O(n)
2.Binary Search:O(log n)

LINEAR SEARCH:(efficient for Small Data Set)
-----------------------
Its not mandatory to move with the sorted data 
     -we can go with sorted and non-sorted
     
->Sequential searching,we can perform searching operation on sequential data .

comparing the target with each element throughout the array OR data

BEST Case:O(1)
AVERAGE Case:O(n)
WORST Case:O(n)

